WEBVTT

00:00:00.670 --> 00:00:03.310
It's been a while, Hank.

00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:06.000
Ca—

00:00:07.110 --> 00:00:08.510
Cain!

00:00:08.510 --> 00:00:12.780
Now, then... I came here 
to give you an invitation.

00:00:15.290 --> 00:00:17.790
The location is written on the card.

00:00:18.420 --> 00:00:21.550
If you promise to show up, 
I'll give her back to you.

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:25.530
I'll be waiting for you at 
the party tomorrow night.

00:00:25.970 --> 00:00:27.710
Cain...

00:02:02.970 --> 00:02:07.980
The King of the Beasts

00:02:48.820 --> 00:02:49.860
Schaal...

00:02:52.510 --> 00:02:53.730
You okay?

00:02:54.350 --> 00:02:55.370
Yeah.

00:02:58.460 --> 00:03:02.780
Who the heck were the guys 
who kidnapped Schaal?

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:07.720
Are they with the monster 
that was in the church?

00:03:08.570 --> 00:03:10.810
If they are, we have to 
hurry up and do something!

00:03:11.810 --> 00:03:15.420
Don't worry. I'll save Schaal.

00:03:58.830 --> 00:04:03.010
Are you always with that Cain person?

00:04:03.630 --> 00:04:06.470
I have a name! It's Miglieglia.

00:04:07.760 --> 00:04:10.350
Miglieglia, who is—

00:04:10.680 --> 00:04:13.200
You have blue eyes, too!

00:04:14.500 --> 00:04:18.680
Miglieglia, do you know what 
that man is trying to—

00:04:19.140 --> 00:04:22.070
Wow! They're so pretty!

00:04:22.490 --> 00:04:23.810
Stop that!

00:04:23.810 --> 00:04:26.850
I love your eyes! Because my—

00:04:34.340 --> 00:04:36.930
You don't have to be so scared.

00:04:36.930 --> 00:04:38.930
I'm not going to eat you.

00:04:38.930 --> 00:04:42.210
You were traveling with 
the captain, weren't you?

00:04:42.890 --> 00:04:44.260
Why is that?

00:04:45.220 --> 00:04:47.540
My father was an Incarnate.

00:04:48.160 --> 00:04:51.390
My name is Nancy Schaal Bancroft.

00:04:52.030 --> 00:04:53.690
Bancroft?

00:04:54.420 --> 00:04:56.640
Oh, so you're...

00:04:57.530 --> 00:05:01.410
What a silly girl. You're traveling 
with the man who killed your father?

00:05:02.530 --> 00:05:06.280
Why did you kidnap me?

00:05:06.280 --> 00:05:08.150
You're just bait, my dear.

00:05:08.610 --> 00:05:11.170
Bait to lure the captain here.

00:05:11.170 --> 00:05:13.010
To lure Hank?

00:05:14.310 --> 00:05:17.780
Why would you go through all this trouble?

00:05:17.780 --> 00:05:20.440
Oh, I don't know...

00:05:20.440 --> 00:05:23.800
I'm just following him 
around because I want to.

00:05:24.410 --> 00:05:27.260
There's no reason for him 
to come and save me.

00:05:27.560 --> 00:05:30.480
Do you really think he's that cold?

00:05:36.770 --> 00:05:40.250
You really are adorable, you know that?

00:05:43.190 --> 00:05:44.980
No!

00:05:46.320 --> 00:05:47.890
Please stop!

00:05:51.190 --> 00:05:53.610
Don't worry.

00:05:54.340 --> 00:05:57.420
We'll make sure you see the captain soon.

00:06:07.400 --> 00:06:09.490
The Incarnate Gargoyle.

00:06:10.000 --> 00:06:13.260
He was probably killed by some of 
the citizens who resented him.

00:06:13.260 --> 00:06:17.280
Sir, we can't seem to find 
Hank Henriette anywhere.

00:06:17.280 --> 00:06:18.220
What?

00:06:18.650 --> 00:06:19.790
What about Cain?

00:06:23.690 --> 00:06:25.930
Find out anything you can, 
no matter how small!

00:06:25.930 --> 00:06:26.680
Yes, sir!

00:06:34.950 --> 00:06:38.190
These are all the people who 
were killed by Gargoyle.

00:06:45.800 --> 00:06:47.170
What about this body?

00:06:48.060 --> 00:06:51.160
It was found a few days ago,

00:06:51.160 --> 00:06:54.050
but we don't think it's connected to Gargoyle.

00:06:55.800 --> 00:06:58.620
He's one of the wealthiest men in this town.

00:06:58.620 --> 00:07:01.130
He appears to have been 
attacked by some animal.

00:07:02.670 --> 00:07:05.010
Do you think it could've been a wild dog?

00:07:08.820 --> 00:07:11.820
Was there another body brought in 
around the same time as this one?

00:07:11.820 --> 00:07:14.280
Actually, yes. There was one more.

00:07:18.240 --> 00:07:23.320
She's actually the wife of the man you just saw,
 but we don't know her cause of death.

00:07:31.560 --> 00:07:33.960
I've found you, Cain!

00:07:33.960 --> 00:07:35.050
Huh?

00:07:35.450 --> 00:07:40.440
This woman devoured her husband 
under Cain's manipulation.

00:07:40.440 --> 00:07:42.150
Where is this couple's mansion?

00:07:42.150 --> 00:07:45.060
I believe it's on the hill 
on the outskirts of town...

00:07:45.060 --> 00:07:48.810
Second Lieutenant Liza Renecastle, 
investigate that mansion immediately.

00:07:48.810 --> 00:07:51.670
Sergeant Gerald Corlani, gather our troops!

00:07:51.670 --> 00:07:53.690
Prepare for battle immediately!

00:07:53.690 --> 00:07:54.570
Yes, sir!

00:07:54.570 --> 00:07:55.640
Okay!

00:07:57.670 --> 00:08:01.150
I'm going to finish this 
once and for all, Cain!

00:08:35.490 --> 00:08:37.030
Good evening.

00:08:37.620 --> 00:08:39.870
I believe this is the first time we've met.

00:08:39.870 --> 00:08:43.800
Are you another one of those fellows who 
suffered some misfortune during the war?

00:08:46.600 --> 00:08:48.050
Well, no matter.

00:08:48.050 --> 00:08:53.210
If you have the opportunity to come here again,
try to be a bit more mindful of your attire.

00:09:10.290 --> 00:09:11.490
Cain!

00:09:23.640 --> 00:09:27.530
Thank you for coming to my evening soirée!

00:09:28.050 --> 00:09:33.710
Everyone gathered here has a very broad 
view of the world, as well as foresight,

00:09:33.710 --> 00:09:37.000
and agrees with my ideals.

00:09:37.630 --> 00:09:42.280
But most of the people in this 
country are not like you.

00:09:42.280 --> 00:09:45.400
They are blinded by the tiny happiness 
they see in front of them

00:09:45.400 --> 00:09:48.660
and haven't noticed that they're playing 
into the government's hands!

00:09:49.280 --> 00:09:53.660
We must never forget that war.

00:09:55.010 --> 00:09:57.330
That war began in the first place

00:09:57.330 --> 00:10:01.600
because the North wanted to hoard the 
profits from the Somnium for themselves.

00:10:01.600 --> 00:10:05.740
So when the South tried to establish trade with 
other countries, the North attacked them.

00:10:05.740 --> 00:10:08.090
Because of that, the economy collapsed,

00:10:08.090 --> 00:10:11.710
and the government used that as 
an excuse to steal our riches.

00:10:11.710 --> 00:10:14.350
They took the most from fine people like you,

00:10:14.350 --> 00:10:19.130
who earned your fortunes through 
blood, sweat, and tears.

00:10:19.130 --> 00:10:23.680
Then they had the nerve to end the war,
 also for selfish reasons,

00:10:23.680 --> 00:10:27.820
which made you lose your chance 
to regain your fortune.

00:10:28.150 --> 00:10:29.480
Yeah!

00:10:29.480 --> 00:10:31.020
You're exactly right!

00:10:31.020 --> 00:10:33.970
I'm sure you know what happened

00:10:33.970 --> 00:10:38.520
to us Incarnates who gave our 
lives to fight for the North.

00:10:38.520 --> 00:10:40.530
We had our honor stolen from us.

00:10:40.990 --> 00:10:46.540
The "peace" that resulted from 
this war actually means our defeat!

00:10:46.540 --> 00:10:50.340
If we'd kept fighting, 
the North definitely would have won!

00:10:47.040 --> 00:10:51.280
Those cowards who feared the power 
of the gods ended that war!

00:10:51.280 --> 00:10:54.500
We are in no way the government's puppets!

00:10:54.500 --> 00:10:56.750
In order to open the eyes of the masses,

00:10:56.750 --> 00:11:02.020
we need a new order to replace our 
government and a place to make that happen.

00:11:02.020 --> 00:11:05.180
My ideals are finally about to be realized,

00:11:05.180 --> 00:11:08.760
thanks to all of the contributions 
you've made to this day!

00:11:14.490 --> 00:11:16.680
We have power!

00:11:16.680 --> 00:11:20.710
The time has finally come to use this 
power to reclaim what we've lost!

00:11:20.710 --> 00:11:25.140
The time to continue that 
war and claim victory!

00:11:26.800 --> 00:11:29.720
Look at these godly forms!

00:11:30.760 --> 00:11:33.200
Let us work together from now o—

00:11:40.380 --> 00:11:44.100
Your usefulness also ends today.

00:11:44.900 --> 00:11:48.240
Goodbye, you vile pigs.

00:12:26.920 --> 00:12:30.230
All Incarnates will lose their souls someday.

00:12:30.230 --> 00:12:31.900
That's what Elaine said.

00:12:32.250 --> 00:12:35.630
She said that we had to die.

00:12:35.630 --> 00:12:36.970
Why is that?!

00:12:36.970 --> 00:12:39.290
Why do we have to die?!

00:12:39.290 --> 00:12:41.600
Because we lose our humanity?

00:12:41.600 --> 00:12:45.000
Do you feel that way as well, Hank?!

00:12:47.950 --> 00:12:51.740
Think back on everything 
you've witnessed up until now.

00:12:52.250 --> 00:12:57.240
The humans we risked our lives to protect 
created Incarnates for their own greed.

00:12:57.240 --> 00:13:01.750
They exploited our power as much as they could 
and, when they deemed us uncontrollable,

00:13:01.750 --> 00:13:05.990
they treated us like a boil, stoned us,
 and killed us as if we were mere beasts!

00:13:06.410 --> 00:13:09.110
Where's the humanity in that?

00:13:09.110 --> 00:13:11.140
There isn't even a trace of it!

00:13:11.880 --> 00:13:15.610
"Those who have lost their souls 
shall be slain by their own."

00:13:16.120 --> 00:13:19.430
We have to die while we're still human?

00:13:19.430 --> 00:13:20.740
Wrong!

00:13:20.740 --> 00:13:24.620
There's no reason for us to be selfish, 
foolish humans to begin with!

00:13:24.940 --> 00:13:30.080
As long as we're alive, our souls may change, 
but they are never lost!

00:13:30.080 --> 00:13:33.020
We will exist how our hearts decide!

00:13:33.020 --> 00:13:38.130
To make that possible, I will eliminate every 
obstacle in our way, by any means necessary.

00:13:39.310 --> 00:13:43.490
How long are you going to make 
them continue these killings?

00:13:43.920 --> 00:13:48.670
Do you actually think... 
that you've become a real god?!

00:13:48.670 --> 00:13:51.210
You'll understand one day!

00:14:15.130 --> 00:14:16.960
Commence attack!

00:15:05.570 --> 00:15:06.600
Cain!

00:15:11.650 --> 00:15:15.340
So my foolish little brother 
has come to try to stop me.

00:15:15.690 --> 00:15:18.220
I've come to kill you!

00:15:18.490 --> 00:15:21.060
Can you actually do that?

00:15:30.200 --> 00:15:31.460
I can!

00:15:57.170 --> 00:15:58.440
Whoa, there.

00:16:27.800 --> 00:16:29.610
Support the captain!

00:16:47.760 --> 00:16:50.950
You'll never reach me that way.

00:17:00.810 --> 00:17:04.740
Now, Hank... Live the way 
your heart truly desires!

00:18:01.340 --> 00:18:05.160
Cain Madhouse... the Incarnate Vampire.

00:18:05.160 --> 00:18:07.710
The immortal king of blood and the night.

00:18:07.710 --> 00:18:10.310
As I feared, this isn't enough to defeat him.

00:18:11.040 --> 00:18:15.060
Join me, Hank. Let's be comrades once again.

00:18:15.630 --> 00:18:16.890
I refuse!

00:18:18.310 --> 00:18:21.220
I see... Then you leave me no choice.

00:18:21.850 --> 00:18:23.030
In that case...

00:18:28.410 --> 00:18:29.560
Schaal!

00:18:30.980 --> 00:18:32.380
Hank!

00:18:33.530 --> 00:18:34.370
Who is that?

00:18:34.990 --> 00:18:36.640
I'll take away everything...

00:18:37.350 --> 00:18:40.100
that is tying you down.

00:18:40.760 --> 00:18:42.420
Don't!

00:18:43.440 --> 00:18:44.690
It's no use.

00:18:44.690 --> 00:18:47.090
You can just sit there and watch.

00:18:57.740 --> 00:18:59.650
Cain!

00:19:00.530 --> 00:19:03.150
You shouldn't get in the way, Captain.

00:19:03.680 --> 00:19:06.620
This is just like the last time.

00:19:54.840 --> 00:19:57.720
That's right, Hank... Remember!

00:19:58.020 --> 00:20:00.830
Remember when we were 
gods on the battlefield!

00:20:01.190 --> 00:20:04.170
The moment we became superior!

00:20:04.170 --> 00:20:08.940
Become your true form and 
tear off the bonds of Gleipnir!

00:20:27.550 --> 00:20:29.700
What... is that?

00:20:32.580 --> 00:20:34.700
This is the true King of Beasts!

00:20:34.700 --> 00:20:39.480
He shall not be tamed by 
the likes of you humans!

00:22:34.480 --> 00:22:37.180
You sure are lucky, you know that?

00:22:59.400 --> 00:23:01.580
Hank disappeared somewhere.

00:23:02.020 --> 00:23:03.180
So did Cain.

00:23:10.640 --> 00:23:11.900
Schaal!

00:23:17.090 --> 00:23:18.770
No...

00:23:19.390 --> 00:23:22.030
Schaal! Schaal!

00:23:25.400 --> 00:23:29.270
In this moment, I declare 
the birth of New Patria!

00:23:29.270 --> 00:23:32.300
I have seen the burdens my father and the 
others had to bear with my own eyes.

00:23:32.300 --> 00:23:34.250
I'm working with this squad right now.

00:23:34.250 --> 00:23:37.010
I intend to carry out my mission, 
no matter the cost.

00:23:37.010 --> 00:23:38.480
Father!

00:23:37.020 --> 00:23:40.010
The Trigger of Memories
